.TH "regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah" "6" "2025-02-17" "Región de Magallanes User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
\f[B]regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah\f[R] - the command to run Región de
Magallanes.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah\f[R] [\f[I]options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]Región de Magallanes\f[R] is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah
(Juippi, Trilkk, Warma) in august 2019.
Ended 4th in the PC 4k intro competition at Assembly 2019.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
-d [ --developer ]
Developer mode.
.TP
-R [ --record ]
Do not play intro normally, instead save audio as .wav and frames as
\&.png -files.
.TP
-r [ --resolution ] arg
Resolution to use, specify as `WIDTHxHEIGHT' or `HEIGHTp'.
.TP
-w [ --window ]
Start in window instead of full-screen.
.TP
-h [ --help ]
Print help text.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]F\f[R]
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
\f[B]Esc\f[R]
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]/usr/share/regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah/\f[R]
Shaders and precalculated soundtrack (FLAC).
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=82448
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
